<title>LATVIA: Latvia's Ventspils oil port reopened.</title>
<headline>Latvia's Ventspils oil port reopened.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Latvian oil port of Ventspils reopened on Thursday afternoon after high winds forced it to close Wednesday night, a port offical told Reuters by telephone.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom +3717 721 52 40</p>
</text>
